      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>How to Navigate:</b>\nTap the blue Search icon, pick a room or filter by category (Office, Lab, Classroom), then tap <i>Start Navigation</i>. Follow the glowing floor runway.\n\n<b>Camera Positioning:</b>\nHold your phone upright at chest/eye level. Point towards doorways, signs, and hallways. Avoid pointing only at blank floors or ceiling.\n\n<b>Walking & Lighting:</b>\nWalk steadily. Avoid sudden rapid twists. Well-lit corridors give the most stable AR tracking.\n\n<b>Staircase (Floor 1 \u2194 Floor 2):</b>\nFollow the yellow staircase markers (AT_02). Waypoints will automatically switch to your new floor as you ascend or descend.\n\n<b>If Tracking Drifts:</b>\nSlowly pan your camera across nearby room entrance doorframes to re-localize instantly."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
